<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDISH OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDISH OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BASTAD, Sweden 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the second</p>
<p>round Swedish Open tennis tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p>Patrik Fredriksson (Sweden) beat Marcus Sarstrand (Sweden)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Carlos Costa (Spain) beat Marcelo Craca (Germany) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Adrian Voinea (Romania) 6-3</p>
<p>3-6 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
